    ('RK_SA_ARCH_2017H2_GK', 'RK_SA_ARCH_2017H2_GK_Q004', 'RISC(精简指令系统计算机）的特点不包括：（4）。', 4, '单选题', '[{"key":"A","text":"指令长度固定，指令种类尽量少","scores":{"score":0}},{"key":"B","text":"寻址方式尽量丰富，指令功能尽可能强","scores":{"score":1}},{"key":"C","text":"增加寄存器数目，以减少访存次数","scores":{"score":0}},{"key":"D","text":"用硬布线电路实现指令解码，以尽快完成指令译码","scores":{"score":0}}]', '{"questionType":"单选题","sourceQuestionNo":4,"correctOptionKey":"B","explanation":"【img:7ed4c8300327108ad4f72c41fc17d375b5a3c5de76ae7f2f6170195a5d1e3c25】","imageHashValues":["7ed4c8300327108ad4f72c41fc17d375b5a3c5de76ae7f2f6170195a5d1e3c25"],"fullExplanation":"【img:7ed4c8300327108ad4f72c41fc17d375b5a3c5de76ae7f2f6170195a5d1e3c25】"}')
